          "benefits": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Type of assistance:",
                  "underline": true
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Financial assistance at a 50% subsidy for purchasing of planting materials, and polypipes."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Financial assistance at a 50% subsidy for the construction of soakage tank."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Pattern of assistance:",
                  "underline": true
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "One-year assistance."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            }
          ],
          "benefits_md": "> **Type of assistance:**\n\n\n- Financial assistance at a 50% subsidy for purchasing of planting materials, and polypipes.\n- Financial assistance at a 50% subsidy for the construction of soakage tank.\n\n> **Pattern of assistance:**\n\n\n- One-year assistance.\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The objectives of the scheme are to boost up the area and production of all plantation crops like Arecanut, Cashewnut, Coconut, Pineapple etc., and to provide a 50 % subsidy for planting materials and construction of a soakage tank.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The scheme “Plantation Crop Development Scheme” was launched by the Department of Agriculture & Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya to boost up the area and production of all plantation crops like Arecanut, Cashewnut, Coconut, Pineapple etc., and to provide 50 % subsidy planting materials and construction of soakage tank."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme “Plantation Crop Development Scheme” was launched by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya to boost up the area and production of all plantation crops like Arecanut, Cashewnut, Coconut, Pineapple etc., and to provide 50 % subsidy planting materials and construction of soakage tank.\n",
